# Nightmares

ce-secret-role-name-werewolf = Werewolf
ce-secret-role-description-werewolf = Turn into a wolf under cover of night. Kill your victims. Make sure this city does not survive.

# City

ce-secret-role-name-sheriff = Sheriff
ce-secret-role-description-sheriff = You are the defender of this city on the brink of darkness. Dark creatures hide among its residents. Find them and destroy every last one.

ce-secret-role-name-civilian = Peaceful Citizen
ce-secret-role-description-civilian = Nothing special! You just want the city to survive.

ce-secret-role-name-murkwalker = Murkwalker
ce-secret-role-description-murkwalker = A rare case of someone immune to the murk. Despite being a useful ability, it makes many deeply suspicious of you.

ce-secret-role-name-thief = Thief
ce-secret-role-description-thief = A city-wide threat? A great opportunity to make some money and pocket other people's valuables while everyone panics.

ce-secret-role-name-lover = Lover
ce-secret-role-description-lover = You're obsessed with one special person. You'll do anything to help them.

ce-secret-role-name-recruiter = Recruiter
ce-secret-role-description-recruiter = You know how to spot people the city has failed. Bring them into the Brotherhood - the more hands, the safer everyone is.

ce-secret-role-name-recruit = Recruit
ce-secret-role-description-recruit = You gave up your old ambitions and swore yourself to the Brotherhood. Its goals are yours now.

ce-secret-role-name-bounty-hunter = Bounty Hunter
ce-secret-role-description-bounty-hunter = You've been paid a large sum of money and hired to wipe out the criminal gang known as the Brotherhood in this city. Do your job.

ce-secret-role-name-priest = Priest
ce-secret-role-description-priest = The light has chosen you as its vessel. You heal the living and return the dead, and that is exactly why someone in this city thirsts for your blood.

ce-secret-role-name-immortal = Immortal
ce-secret-role-description-immortal = You are incredibly hard to kill. One might even say almost impossible.

ce-secret-role-name-vandal = Vandal
ce-secret-role-description-vandal = Oh, you're against the way things are and the sheriff's grip on the city. Let's wreck the place a little.

# Coven

ce-secret-role-name-seer = Seer
ce-secret-role-description-seer = You gaze into souls and see the true nature of the people around you. Uncover hidden roles and use that information to achieve your goals.
